    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Bridging Offline and Online <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span> for LLMs
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lanchantin%2C+J">Jack Lanchantin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+A">Angelica Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lan%2C+J">Janice Lan</a>, 
      
