    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Mobile-R1: Towards Interactive Capability for VLM-Based Mobile Agent via Systematic Training
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gu%2C+J">Jihao Gu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ai%2C+Q">Qihang Ai</a>, 
      
